\begin{defn}
Let $\rho\in\mathcal{S}\left(\mathcal{H}_{d}\right)$.  Then the relative
entropy of magic is $\relent{\rho}\equiv\min_{\sigma\in\stabset d}S\left(\rho\|\sigma\right)$. 
